    <string name="settings_remote">Remote control (Discord)</string>
    <string name="remote_explain">Extend time, lock or unlock from your phone by posting in a private Discord channel. You need your own Discord bot: create one at discord.com/developers, turn on its "Message Content Intent", add it to a private channel it can read and write in, and paste its token, the channel id and your own user id below. Only the user ids you list are obeyed. Commands: status, lock, unlock, extend 30, extend until 8:30pm, limit 90, limit off, reset.</string>
